# Tagging run on every card in the starter decks (10 decks, 571 distinct cards, 571 tagged, 0 without a script). Sources: card script (Oracle section as gap filler), Forge AI reference. Rules: human_logic.toon H50-H55, design deckgen/TAG_LINKS.md. Tags run supertype, cardtype, subtype/landtype, kw + qualifiers, ability tags. duration:eot(forge_default) = a Pump with no Duration (Forge removes it at end of turn). Generated by deckgen/tag_run.py; research output, no card or deck was changed.

# Each record has a typing: line (supertype, cardtype, type, landtype: what the card is) and a tags: line (what its abilities do). Tag meanings (pinned reference text, one line per family): tags/TAG_LEGEND.md. Zone moves use shared tags: from_zone:<zone> and to_zone:<zone> next to return, take, put_onto_battlefield, cost:exile.
card: "Nazar, the Velvet Fang"
typing: supertype:legendary cardtype:creature type:vampire type:warlock
tags: kw:menace draw evasion trigger:gain_life counter_count:1 counter:feeding trigger:attacks cost:remove_counters draw_count:3 life_loss_amount:3 life_loss
ai_tags: tempo:+3
face: mv:4 power:3 toughness:3 colors:b
derived: evasion_pkg
clauses[2]{id,trigger,cost,verb,payload,affected,duration}:
  c1,gain_life,"",putcounter,countertype=FEEDING,Defined=Self,""
  c2,attacks,"",draw+loselife,numcards=3 lifeamount=3,Defined=You Defined=You,""
links[2]{from,rel,to}:
  c1:affected,receives,c1:payload
  c2:affected,receives,c2:payload
groups[7]{id,source,tags}:
  k1,K line,kw:menace
  c1,T line,trigger:gain_life
  c1.2,sub-ability of c1,counter_count:1 counter:feeding
  c2,T line,trigger:attacks
  c2.2,sub-ability of c2,cost:remove_counters draw_count:3
  c2.3,sub-ability of c2,life_loss_amount:3
  v,cross-check (oracle gap filler/keyword/ai),life_loss
forge_ai: AILogic=-

